<h2 class="ds-section-title">Get started</h2>

<div class="ds-grid-2">
  <div class="ds-grid-content">
    <p class="ds-intro-text">
      DB Diff compares one table across two databases and reports the primary keys of the rows that differ. It pushes
      the comparison into the databases as checksum queries, so only checksums cross the wire when the tables match.
    </p>

    <div class="ds-features-grid">
      <div class="ds-feature-card">
        <h3>Multi-Engine</h3>
        <p>PostgreSQL, MySQL, and ClickHouse</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-feature-card">
        <h3>Blazing fast</h3>
        <p>Server-side MD5 chunking, only hashes cross the wire</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-feature-card">
        <h3>Pinpoint precision</h3>
        <p>Automatic drill-down to the exact differing rows</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-feature-card">
        <h3>Column control</h3>
        <p>Include or exclude columns to skip noise</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ds-grid-terminal">
    <div class="ds-install-card">
      <h3>Install in one line</h3>
      <div class="ds-terminal__command">
        <span class="ds-terminal__prompt">$</span> go install matto.club/vetrina/db-diff@latest
      </div>
      <div class="ds-terminal__command">
        <span class="ds-terminal__prompt">$</span> brew tap clubmatto/vetrina https://github.com/clubmatto/vetrina &&
        brew install clubmatto/vetrina/db-diff
      </div>
      <p class="ds-install-note">Requires Go 1.24+ or Homebrew.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="https://github.com/clubmatto/vetrina/blob/main/db-diff/README.md" class="ds-btn-outline">Read the docs</a>
